WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.625
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.500
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.250
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:29.000
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.417
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.292
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.208
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:43.500
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.417
FOUR-EYED OWL DEMON – YOTSUME

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.458
Geez, how far is he going to go?

00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.875
MOROHA     SETSUNA
Geez, how far is he going to go?

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.833
YOUNG RACCOON DOG DEMON –
TAKECHIYO

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:02.917
Sob...

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.458
How rude! I can't believe you
just jumped over me like that!

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.917
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI
Please give me a lift! I beg you!

00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:15.208
It's impossible for me
to catch up to those two!

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:19.417
– And why should I...
– Here!

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.542
This is super tasty! What is this?

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:27.750
Rock Paper Scissor Gummies.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.958
ROCK PAPER SCISSOR GUMMIES
I have a lot more.

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.750
Hold on tight, okay?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.625
"The Dream Gazing Trap"

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.792
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
Night fishing? You've got taste.

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:39.792
CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
Why, if it isn't Lord Riku.

00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:45.458
You needn't have come all this way.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.917
You can call on Takechiyo anytime
to get business done.

00:03:53.083 --> 00:03:54.208
I met her.

00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:56.542
Met who, sir?

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.042
Lord Sesshomaru's daughter.

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:02.042
I believe her name was...
Lady Towa?

00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:04.292
I like her.

00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:06.583
She's got something we don't.

00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:11.292
Those girls can probably defeat
the Four Perils for you.

00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:15.750
Never liked the Four Perils.

00:04:16.042 --> 00:04:17.458
They lack taste.

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:22.625
Well, I for one cannot thank you enough
for your continued patronage.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.375
Mr. Jyubei, please have the
remaining Four Perils defeated.

00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:33.250
I've decided that I'll be taking
their Rainbow Pearls.

00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:38.917
Understood, sir.

00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:44.500
However, with your powers,
you could easily destroy the Four Perils

00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.250
without having to put a bounty on them.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.792
Come on now. Like I said...

00:04:52.875 --> 00:04:55.667
I hate the Four Perils.

00:04:56.292 --> 00:05:00.792
It's my policy to only kill
the ones I love.

00:05:03.875 --> 00:05:05.250
And so,

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:09.917
I'll get the Half-Demon Princesses
and their three Rainbow Pearls.

00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:16.000
I just wonder if I can wait
until I have all seven Pearls...

00:05:23.792 --> 00:05:25.333
How could this be?!

00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:30.333
There's no way I can deal with
all three ferocious girls at once!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.083
Lady Kyuki! Lady Kyuki!

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:38.042
Why? Why do throw me away like this?

00:05:38.042 --> 00:05:40.083
You fool!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:41.708
Lady Kyuki?

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:47.042
Did you not notice? The Half-Demon
Princesses are close behind you!

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:51.917
My sincerest apologies!

00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:56.792
Is this a Rainbow Pearl?

00:05:57.083 --> 00:06:02.208
Yotsume. Use this and
find each of their weaknesses.

00:06:02.375 --> 00:06:05.375
Use your power to the fullest.

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:06.833
My power?

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:08.750
The Dream Gazing spell.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.542
Oh, yes, that's right.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.500
Make sure you also look into

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.167
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KYUKI
Towa's Reiwa world.

00:06:17.083 --> 00:06:21.750
Thank you for allowing me to use
the Rainbow Pearl's demon energy!

00:06:35.292 --> 00:06:37.333
So this is Kyuki's fortress.

00:06:38.083 --> 00:06:40.542
Thanks for showing us here, Yotsume.

00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:45.208
What's this?
Looks like you've gotten a makeover.

00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:46.875
Shut up!

00:06:47.125 --> 00:06:49.792
You won't get away.
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:06:55.917 --> 00:06:57.542
All right, got you!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.333
I'll send you to the afterlife
with my Kurikaramaru!

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:04.000
Crimson Dragon... what?

00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:05.292
Idiot.

00:07:05.667 --> 00:07:07.167
– What?
– Moroha!

00:07:07.792 --> 00:07:09.208
My... my strength...

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:17.583
<i>What the hell? I can't move.</i>

00:07:17.917 --> 00:07:18.833
Moroha!

00:07:19.208 --> 00:07:20.292
Are you okay?

00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:24.000
Don't let your guard down.
He's pretty dangerous.

00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:28.417
You're next.

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:34.500
Takechiyo, fly faster.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.583
I'm already flying pretty fast.

00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:39.333
Go faster!
Here, stick out your tongue.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:44.792
Delicious!

00:07:44.792 --> 00:07:47.458
It's the Rock Paper Scissors
pineapple flavor.

00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:50.125
Keep it on your tongue!
It'll change flavor.

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:52.667
All right! I'm fired up now!

00:07:52.917 --> 00:07:56.875
You can do it!
I also have chocolate candy, too.

00:07:56.875 --> 00:07:59.083
Here I go!

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:02.542
Eat this!

00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:10.833
It's useless if you hide.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.792
Come on out.

00:08:13.042 --> 00:08:13.792
Take this!

00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:25.000
What? This one doesn't dream?

00:08:25.292 --> 00:08:26.500
Setsuna!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.125
Towa, stay back!

00:08:29.667 --> 00:08:32.083
The third Half-Demon Princess is here.

00:08:32.583 --> 00:08:33.708
Take this!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.375
What is this?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.375
I can't move?

00:08:43.542 --> 00:08:45.167
Towa, wake up.

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:46.500
Towa!

00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:49.750
Setsuna.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.583
Towa!

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:51.917
I'm sorry.

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:53.208
Towa!

00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:57.000
Time to show me the future,
Princess Half-Demon!

00:08:58.458 --> 00:09:00.458
What a handful you all are.

00:09:02.583 --> 00:09:07.500
<i>I see. He's peeking inside their heads</i>
<i>to look for a weakness.</i>

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:08.833
<i>If so...</i>

00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:10.042
Rise!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.958
Cyclone Burst!

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:25.833
CORPSE DEALER

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:28.208
You're leaving the young lord with me?

00:09:32.292 --> 00:09:35.125
What did the Elder,
Hachi the Raccoon Dog, say?

00:09:36.792 --> 00:09:42.792
I see. But if you leave him here,
I'll have to put him to work.

00:09:42.792 --> 00:09:45.750
I can't treat him like I did before.

00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:50.250
<i>Huh? So this is a dream.</i>

00:09:50.708 --> 00:09:53.417
<i>Why am I having a dream like this?</i>

00:09:53.417 --> 00:09:55.750
<i>Whose dream is this anyway?</i>

00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:04.875
<i>Where is this?</i>

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.583
You're such a good child.

00:10:11.208 --> 00:10:12.417
Kagome!

00:10:12.667 --> 00:10:14.208
They're here!

00:10:14.208 --> 00:10:15.083
Okay.

00:10:20.917 --> 00:10:24.042
This is a keepsake
from Inuyasha's mother.

00:10:25.167 --> 00:10:28.667
We decided that if we had a girl,
we would give this to her.

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:36.500
Mr. Hachi, please take care of her.

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:45.250
<i>What? Oh no.</i>
<i>That's Lord Kirinmaru over there!</i>

00:10:50.667 --> 00:10:51.750
<i>A butterfly?</i>

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.333
<i>Did I become a butterfly?</i>

00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:09.833
<i>Poor thing. So this is how Setsuna</i>
<i>is getting her dreams taken away.</i>

00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:15.667
Are you prepared?

00:11:15.792 --> 00:11:18.833
Why? Why don't you have any dreams?

00:11:20.833 --> 00:11:23.250
I'm not so weak
that I have to depend on dreams.

00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:24.958
Scourge of Swallows!

00:11:34.167 --> 00:11:36.792
Is that... a Rainbow Pearl?

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:39.125
So he was using that.

00:11:39.125 --> 00:11:40.542
Setsuna!

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.958
So you've woken up?

00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:47.125
Yotsume. You were completely useless.

00:11:47.333 --> 00:11:49.750
But the spell is still in effect.

00:11:50.208 --> 00:11:53.250
Now, what kind of dream will you have?

00:11:55.125 --> 00:11:57.167
<i>That's the Sacred Tree.</i>

00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:06.000
So you've returned, butterfly.

00:12:06.458 --> 00:12:07.792
<i>This voice...</i>

00:12:08.167 --> 00:12:11.042
<i>I see, so the Tree of Ages is speaking.</i>

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.542
<i>Who is this woman?</i>

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.083
<i>So pitiful.</i>

00:12:23.542 --> 00:12:29.625
<i>Not being able to sleep is harrowing,</i>
<i>but so, too, is a ceaseless slumber.</i>

00:12:30.625 --> 00:12:34.458
<i>Do you not agree, </i>
<i>daughter of Sesshomaru?</i>

00:12:38.875 --> 00:12:40.375
Finally.

00:12:40.375 --> 00:12:41.625
You're awake.

00:12:41.625 --> 00:12:43.542
It's great you woke up.

00:12:45.292 --> 00:12:47.667
That dream just now...

00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:49.083
Where's Yotsume?

00:12:49.167 --> 00:12:51.708
Surprise, surprise!

00:12:51.708 --> 00:12:55.250
Setsuna's already slain Yotsume.

00:12:56.208 --> 00:12:59.250
He's been burned
without a trace of him left!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.375
Aw man, Setsuna! We were supposed
to get information out of him!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.167
I know, so horrible, right?

00:13:06.167 --> 00:13:09.333
We were in a situation
where we had no such luxury.

00:13:09.333 --> 00:13:12.292
Hey, this is not the time to be fighting!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.083
The real show starts now!

00:13:14.083 --> 00:13:17.250
We're about to charge in
to one of the Four Peril's fortress!

00:13:17.542 --> 00:13:18.375
Yes.

00:13:18.375 --> 00:13:19.500
I know, geez.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.500
This time, I'll be sure to collect that bounty.

00:13:31.167 --> 00:13:35.458
It was a mixture of dreams,
but I think I understand what's going on.

00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:40.333
And to think the Tree of Ages
was involved in this incident...

00:13:44.167 --> 00:13:45.875
Hey, Kyuki!

00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:51.042
Peeking into people's dreams?
You've got horrible taste.

00:13:51.542 --> 00:13:53.875
So you've come,
Half-Demon Princesses.

00:13:55.208 --> 00:13:58.375
You reckless creatures are
Master Kirinmaru's enemies...

00:13:58.583 --> 00:14:03.417
I, Kyuki of the Four Perils, shall punish you
in Master Kirinmaru's place!

00:14:11.458 --> 00:14:13.250
Kyuki of the Four Perils?

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.750
We took care of Tokotsu,
so there's only three of you left.

00:14:17.417 --> 00:14:21.042
We've even defeated your underlings,
Fubuki and Yotsume.

00:14:21.042 --> 00:14:22.833
So you're bare-handed!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:27.875
You're a million years too early if
you think you can take us on now!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.958
Why don't you just give up already!

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.000
How spirited you are.

00:14:33.208 --> 00:14:35.208
However, Half-Demon Princesses,

00:14:35.792 --> 00:14:40.583
did you think I would be done
after looking into your dreams?

00:14:41.333 --> 00:14:42.083
What?

00:14:42.375 --> 00:14:44.000
Do you think I'm lying?

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:47.208
Go on, use your precious rouge
and become Beniyasha.

00:14:47.292 --> 00:14:50.750
Now I'm mad.
You better not regret this.

00:14:54.167 --> 00:14:55.292
Wait, Moroha.

00:14:55.292 --> 00:14:57.750
She's up to something.
Don't do it!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:02.917
With this rouge, I become Beniyasha,
Destroyer of Lands!

00:15:03.208 --> 00:15:07.458
Tremble before the bloodthirsty dawn!
Bear witness to your end, if you so dare!

00:15:11.208 --> 00:15:12.792
Huh? What?

00:15:13.042 --> 00:15:16.833
I tweaked Yotsume's
Dream Gazing a little.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:21.167
I had this Rainbow Pearl
absorb your demon energy.

00:15:29.417 --> 00:15:31.833
Oh no, even Kikujumonji...

00:15:32.292 --> 00:15:36.958
Then it looks like I'm the only one
who can face you.

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:41.292
How far will you fare against me
on your own?

00:15:58.083 --> 00:15:59.292
I see.

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:02.500
You did say you were not so weak
to rely on dreams,

00:16:02.667 --> 00:16:04.500
but looks like that wasn't a lie.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.125
Brace yourself,
Princess Half-Demon.

00:16:23.292 --> 00:16:25.375
So that's your true form.

00:16:25.375 --> 00:16:27.125
Scourge of Swallows!

00:16:29.958 --> 00:16:30.875
What?

00:16:31.083 --> 00:16:37.083
My Rainbow Pearl can gather
all the demon energy here.

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.542
Not good, Towa.

00:16:39.542 --> 00:16:42.750
Can you think of something?
At this rate, Setsuna will...

00:16:43.167 --> 00:16:46.250
That's right! When you went up
against that ghost cat,

00:16:46.583 --> 00:16:50.417
you absorbed its demon energy
without killing the monk.

00:16:51.625 --> 00:16:56.250
Grandpa Myoga said you have
the power to steal demon energy.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:00.417
But I was so desperate,
I don't really remember what I did.

00:17:00.417 --> 00:17:03.083
In other words,
this is what you have to do.

00:17:03.083 --> 00:17:04.542
Iron-Reaver, Soul-Stealer!

00:17:06.292 --> 00:17:08.042
What the hell, Moroha?!

00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:11.708
Try transferring that demon energy
into Kikujumonji.

00:17:12.625 --> 00:17:13.833
Transfer it?

00:17:19.208 --> 00:17:20.083
It grew a little.

00:17:20.583 --> 00:17:23.125
The more demon energy
attacks you take,

00:17:23.125 --> 00:17:25.917
the more you can
reflect it all back tenfold.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:31.500
But this only works if you can
withstand your opponent's attacks.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.042
If you can't withstand it...

00:17:34.542 --> 00:17:35.792
You'll die.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.583
Well, of course.

00:17:37.708 --> 00:17:40.708
Towa, this is an ability that only you have.

00:17:41.083 --> 00:17:43.208
Listen, you only have one chance.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.167
All right, I'll try it.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.792
Over here, Kyuki.

00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:58.333
Towa, don't push yourself.

00:18:02.875 --> 00:18:04.125
It's the leftover demon energy.

00:18:09.542 --> 00:18:10.333
All right.

00:18:10.792 --> 00:18:12.625
Towa's demon blade grew?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:17.167
I see. She's absorbing the
demon energy that she gets hit with.

00:18:17.833 --> 00:18:19.292
Good work.

00:18:19.458 --> 00:18:21.167
I can't be standing around.

00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:22.958
Cyclone Burst!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.292
Again?

00:18:28.583 --> 00:18:31.167
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:18:31.333 --> 00:18:35.333
All of your demon energy
is being absorbed by this Pearl.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.625
Towa, you've got one chance. Just one!

00:18:40.875 --> 00:18:41.625
<i>Now!</i>

00:18:42.917 --> 00:18:44.083
What?

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:47.042
All right!

00:18:47.583 --> 00:18:48.208
Towa!

00:18:56.667 --> 00:18:58.625
Looks like I made it in time.

00:18:59.208 --> 00:19:03.833
It's unusual for you, Lord Riku,
to personally come observe things.

00:19:05.583 --> 00:19:07.417
I simply felt like it.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.083
<i>Now, please show me, Lady Towa.</i>

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.250
<i>The Azure Dragon Wave you inherited</i>
<i>from Lord Sesshomaru.</i>

00:19:21.042 --> 00:19:21.875
Amazing.

00:19:22.375 --> 00:19:23.667
Take this!

00:19:28.917 --> 00:19:30.167
Oh, no.

00:19:30.167 --> 00:19:31.833
She has enough demon energy,

00:19:31.833 --> 00:19:34.708
but she didn't put enough drive
behind her swing!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:38.458
A laughable attempt,
even with that demon energy!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.125
Does she still not
have enough resolve?

00:19:42.292 --> 00:19:43.500
Why...

00:19:44.583 --> 00:19:45.667
Why?

00:19:47.458 --> 00:19:48.667
Why?

00:19:49.083 --> 00:19:50.667
Why!

00:19:50.667 --> 00:19:52.083
Towa, watch out.

00:19:55.667 --> 00:19:56.833
Setsuna.

00:19:57.583 --> 00:19:58.417
Setsuna!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.833
Hey, Setsuna. Setsuna!

00:20:01.917 --> 00:20:03.208
Setsuna!

00:20:03.708 --> 00:20:05.000
Oh, no.

00:20:06.208 --> 00:20:07.708
It happened again.

00:20:08.333 --> 00:20:10.125
Look out!

00:20:13.917 --> 00:20:15.583
I'm always the one being saved.

00:20:18.833 --> 00:20:21.083
Even though I'm the older sister...

00:20:22.333 --> 00:20:23.083
What?

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:51.542
Setsuna!

00:20:52.958 --> 00:20:54.083
Are you okay?

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.625
This is nothing.
I just fainted for a little bit.

00:20:57.625 --> 00:20:59.250
Setsuna!

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.375
Oh, thank goodness!

00:21:04.417 --> 00:21:06.125
Y-You're...

00:21:06.792 --> 00:21:08.625
That was pathetic.

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:14.333
Riku...

00:21:14.792 --> 00:21:17.875
Defeated by that
half-assed Azure Dragon Wave...

00:21:20.542 --> 00:21:23.417
Damn you, Riku...

00:21:24.833 --> 00:21:26.833
This is why I hate you all.

00:21:27.792 --> 00:21:30.125
Okay, hold still. There!

00:21:30.125 --> 00:21:31.292
What is this?

00:21:32.167 --> 00:21:33.417
A band-aid.

00:21:33.417 --> 00:21:35.000
Lady Towa.

00:21:35.167 --> 00:21:38.792
Oh, Riku?
What are you doing here?

00:21:39.792 --> 00:21:40.625
Well, I...

00:21:40.625 --> 00:21:45.417
Hey, show some respect!
This is our highly esteemed client, Lord Riku!

00:21:45.417 --> 00:21:47.792
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:50.292
Half-Demon Princesses.

00:21:50.458 --> 00:21:55.500
Good work defeating Kyuki.
Here's your reward, one bag of gold!

00:21:57.458 --> 00:21:59.958
I don't have to worry
about starving to death!

00:21:59.958 --> 00:22:01.875
Lady Towa, I must take my leave.

00:22:01.875 --> 00:22:03.167
Okay, see you around!

00:22:04.083 --> 00:22:05.417
--Oh, and don't forget our promise!

00:22:05.417 --> 00:22:06.625
--<i>However, I'll be taking this...</i>
--Oh, and don't forget our promise!

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:08.542
<i>--However, I'll be taking this...</i>
--Let me try that "chocolate"!

00:22:08.542 --> 00:22:10.000
<i>--...my dear princess.</i>
--Oh, that's right.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.625
I'll bring some next time, I promise!

00:23:42.875 --> 00:23:44.417
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.417 --> 00:23:45.958
How disgusting.

00:23:46.125 --> 00:23:49.583
Do not put me in the same league
as this country's demons.

00:23:49.583 --> 00:23:54.833
Konton, a demon from the mainland,
killed Meifuku's father, Meioju.

00:23:54.833 --> 00:23:58.167
We'll help you out.
So go on now! Get in there.

00:23:58.167 --> 00:24:02.292
Moroha tries to use the invincible shell
as a shield, but wait, what?

00:24:02.292 --> 00:24:05.708
That person is scary,
so I'll just be the armor, okay?

00:24:05.708 --> 00:24:08.917
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Meifuku, the Meioju"

00:24:08.917 --> 00:24:22.678
I don't think I can win at all!
